    "text": "Anoushka Pandey takes female 13-17 division at Summer Breeze in San Leandro on Aug. 1, 2026\nBy\nB. N. HaagSummer Breeze featured Anoushka Pandey as the winner of the female 13-17 division of the half marathon in San Leandro, California, on Aug. 1, 2026, according to RunSignUp results. Pandey finished in 1:53:50 and was 70th overall.\nPandey was listed as being from Pleasanton, California.",
